									{t.author}
								</p>
								<p class="text-xs font-mono text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 mb-0!">
									{t.title}
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</Col>
				))
			}
		</Row>
	</Section>

	{/* Section 8: Frequently Asked Questions */}
	<Section classes="py-20! bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900/30 border-y border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800">
		<Row style="transparent">
			<Col span="12" style="transparent">
				<div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
					<p class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 mb-2">
						Got Questions?
					</p>
					<h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">
						Frequently Asked Questions
					</h2>
				</div>

				<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
					{
						SEO.faq.map((item) => (
							<details class="group border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-950 p-6 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
								<summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-bold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white text-base sm:text-lg">
									<span>{item.question}</span>
									<span class="transition duration-300 group-open:-rotate-180 text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400">
										<Icon name="chevron-down" class="size-5" />
									</span>
								</summary>
								<p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed pt-2 border-t border-neutral-100 dark:border-neutral-800/80">
									{item.answer}
